{"id":"wb-6-342","name":"弘济桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"弘济桥","text":"弘济桥是一座位于中国河北省邯郸市永年区东桥村的古桥，第六批全国重点文物保护单位。此桥始建年代不详，明万历年间重修。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%98%E6%B5%8E%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":92055810,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92055810","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8c48740621c7a50a3c5ceb5d.jpg","title":"Hongji_Bridge_5.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hongji_Bridge_5.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/Hongji_Bridge_5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"我乃野云鹤","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​弘济桥位于河北邯郸市永年县广府古城城东2.5公里的东桥村，距邯郸市20公里，所处的滏阳河段为南北流向，东西横跨滏阳河上，故为东西横跨桥，东桥村因在桥东而得名。又因其位于广府古城东，当地人也称之为“东桥”、“老东桥”。全国重点文物保护单位。","width":320,"height":240}}